# HTTP adapters

- Success/error via `success` / `failure` / `failureWithDetails` — keep envelope `{ok,data,meta,error}`.
- Register contract routes with `v1.Register(router, groupMiddleware(), handlerFor)` — auth chain then group chain then handler.
- Stub unimplemented ops with `501` + `operation_id`, `route_group`, `auth_mode`.
- Global middleware: request ID, security headers, access log, recovery.
- Access logs may include `operation_id`, `route_group`, `auth_mode` — never secrets.
- Tests: `httptest` + real router; assert status and `error.code`.
